    <h1>What Is a Good Bench Press for a <em>Natural Lifter?</em></h1>
    <p class="masthead-sub">16 years. 1,300 athletes coached. 375 lbs raw at 190 bodyweight. Here is what good actually looks like — and why most guys are aiming at the wrong number.</p>
    <div class="meta-row">
      <span>Jordan Hoppel</span>
      <span class="dot">·</span>
      <span>Strength Coach</span>
      <span class="dot">·</span>
      <span>May 2025</span>
      <span class="dot">·</span>
